# Generated client JS

Files in `public/js/` are terser output from `scripts/minify-js.mjs`.

- Edit the matching file in `src/client/`
- Do not hand-edit minified files in `public/js/`
- Regenerate with `node scripts/minify-js.mjs` only when the user wants browser runtime testing or before deploy
